It depends on the following third-party projects, which are downloaded at setup time and are NOT
redistributed in this repository. Check each project for its current license terms before redistributing
or using them commercially.

- FASHN VTON v1.5 (code: https://github.com/fashn-AI/fashn-vton-1.5, Apache-2.0;
  weights: https://huggingface.co/fashn-ai/fashn-vton-1.5)
- DWPose ONNX models as packaged by FASHN (https://huggingface.co/fashn-ai/DWPose)
- FASHN human parser (https://pypi.org/project/fashn-human-parser/)
- laya decision engine (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya, Apache-2.0;
  models: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations)
- PyTorch, FastAPI, Pydantic, OpenCV, Pillow, NumPy, ONNX Runtime and other packages listed in requirements/

Bundled sample data
- samples/persons/*: photos of people who do not exist, generated with an image model for testing.
- catalog/*: mock e-commerce listings. Product images were generated with an image model; all listing data
  (prices, attributes, size charts, model references) is fictional and marked source="mock".
